## Key Concepts

- CKNE-to-routing and depth mapping
- Backpressure and resource reallocation
- Incremental caching and warm/cold budgets
- Telemetry, SLAs, and rollback safety

## Code Example

```javascript
function adjustForCKNE(tenantCKNE, req) {
  const baseDepth = 6;
  if (tenantCKNE < 0.3) {
    req.depth = Math.min(req.depth || baseDepth, 3);
    req.rateLimit = Math.min(req.rateLimit || 200, 100);
  } else if (tenantCKNE > 0.7) {
    req.depth = Math.max(req.depth || baseDepth, 8);
    req.cacheHint = 'warm';
  }
}
```

